**发送链路是 raw GATT，非 SDK typed：**

```18:37:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/service/glasses_command_sender.dart
/// Sends glasses protocol frames through the active generic GATT connection.
class GlassesCommandSender {
  /// Sends [frame] to the device, serialised with any in-flight write.
  Future<Result<void>> send(List<int> frame) => _writer.write(frame);
```

**`common_ble_protocol` 中还有但未在 translate Feature 使用的 SimInter 指令：**
- `sendSimInterStatus` / `sendSimInterTtsState`（```431:448:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/protocol/glasses_order.dart```）
- 设备侧事件 `GlassesSimInterCommandEvent` / `GlassesSimInterRecordEvent`（```163:193:packages/common/common_ble_protocol/lib/src/protocol/glasses_event.dart```）

完整 SimInter BLE 双向逻辑在 **`feature_interpretation`**（同传），不在 translate Feature。

