### 1B. `feature_offline_translate`（离线双键翻译）

**结论：纯 App 离线 ASR/翻译 + 手机 TTS，可选单向 BLE 推送译文 → 涉及设备交互-仍用 raw 协议**

| 维度 | 现状 |
|---|---|
| 翻译 | 本地 `OfflineSpeechEngine`（语言包 ASR + translate） |
| TTS | `FlutterTts`（手机端） |
| BLE | 仅 `_pushBle` → `sendSimInterText` |
| 语言包管理 | HTTP 下载，无 BLE |

**目录结构：**
```
packages/feature/ai/feature_offline_translate/
├── lib/src/controller/offline_translate_controller.dart  # 包管理 + 双键会话 + BLE
├── lib/src/model/offline_translate_state.dart
└── lib/src/pages/offline_translate_session_page.dart / offline_translate_packs_page.dart
```

**离线引擎 + BLE 推送：**

```228:288:packages/feature/ai/feature_offline_translate/lib/src/controller/offline_translate_controller.dart
    final tr = await _engine.translate(text: source, from: from, to: to);
    // ...
    unawaited(_speak(translated));
    unawaited(_pushBle(translated));
  // ...
  Future<void> _pushBle(String text) async {
    if (!ref.read(bleSessionProvider).isConnected) return;
    final frame = GlassesOrder.sendSimInterText(
      content: text,
      isStream: false,
      isAsr: false,
    );
    await ref.read(glassesCommandSenderProvider).send(frame);
```

**关于 `sendPlayerEnd` / `IsSupportPlay`：** 全仓 `.dart` 无引用；仅在 vendor SDK `TranslateService.swift` 中存在，**未接入 Flutter translate/offline_translate Feature**。

