## 任务 2：P2P/AP 视频预览现状

**结论：涉及设备交互-两者都有（SDK typed 网络会话建链 + RTSP 播放器拉流；BK 预览未实现）**

### `core_visual_stream` 实现方式

| 实现 | 路径 | 用途 |
|---|---|---|
| `MockVisualStream` | `lib/src/impl/mock_visual_stream.dart` | 默认 provider |
| `MediaKitVisualStream` | `lib/src/impl/media_kit_visual_stream.dart` | RTSP/URL（iOS 预览首选） |
| `FijkVisualStream` | `lib/src/impl/fijk_visual_stream.dart` | 低延迟 RTSP（Android 预览首选） |
| `CameraVisualStream` | `lib/src/impl/camera_visual_stream.dart` | 手机相机 |
| `PlatformVisualStream` | `lib/src/impl/platform_visual_stream.dart` | 占位，未实现 |

P2P/AP 预览在 **`common_device_wifi_link`** 的 `DeviceNetworkVisualStream`，不在 `core_visual_stream` 包内。

### AKW/BK P2P/AP 是否已实现

| 平台 | AKW | BK |
|---|---|---|
| **Android 预览** | ✅ P2P（`androidP2pNetworkSession`） | ❌ 明确拒绝（需 SmartCamera，无 RTSP） |
| **Android 音乐网络** | ✅ P2P | ✅ AP |
| **iOS 预览** | ✅ AP（`IosAkApNetworkSession`） | ❌ 同上 |
| **iOS 音乐网络** | ✅ AP | ✅ AP |

**Android 原生插件（SDK typed）：**

```165:190:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/android/src/main/kotlin/com/smartdevice/platform/core_device_native_runtime/CoreDeviceNetworkSessionPlugin.kt
    private fun createSession(...): NativeNetworkSession = when (val identity = session.glassesCapabilityIdentity()) {
        is DeviceGlassesCapabilityIdentity.Supported -> when (identity.family) {
            DeviceGlassesSdkFamily.AKW -> AkwNetworkSession(
                AkGlassesControllers.androidP2pNetworkSession(
                    applicationContext, session, AkGlassesEventParser(), AndroidAkNetworkOptions(),
                ),
            )
            DeviceGlassesSdkFamily.BK -> {
                if (use == DeviceNetworkUseMessage.PREVIEW) {
                    throw unsupported("BK preview requires a SmartCamera provider and has no RTSP endpoint")
                }
                BkNetworkSessionAdapter(
                    BkGlassesControllers.androidApNetworkSession(...),
                )
            }
```

**iOS 原生插件：**

```154:167:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/ios/core_device_native_runtime/Sources/core_device_native_runtime/CoreDeviceNetworkSessionPlugin.swift
  private static func createSession(session: WearfitBLESession, use: DeviceNetworkUseMessage) throws -> NativeNetworkSession {
    switch glassesCapabilityIdentity(for: session) {
    case .supported(.akw):
      return AkwNetworkSession(IosAkApNetworkSession(session: session))
    case .supported(.bk):
      guard use != .preview else {
        throw error("device_network.capability_unsupported", "BK preview requires a SmartCamera provider and has no RTSP endpoint")
      }
```

### Dart 侧 typed client

| 类 | 路径 | 方法 |
|---|---|---|
| `DeviceNetworkSessionClient` | `lib/src/network/service/device_network_session_client.dart` | `acquire()` / `release()` / `invalidations` |
| `PigeonDeviceNetworkSessionClient` | `lib/src/network/impl/pigeon_device_network_session_client.dart` | Pigeon → 原生 `session.akwGlasses` / `session.bkGlasses` |

