```

**`glasses_app` 接线：**

```255:266:apps/glasses_app/lib/app.dart
        ] else ...[
          // No explicit URL — acquire the SDK-owned device network for RTSP.
          visualStreamProvider.overrideWith((ref) {
            final stream = DeviceNetworkVisualStream(
