## 任务 3：`feature_device_music` 现状（简要）

**结论：涉及设备交互-两者都有（raw BLE 会话帧 + SDK typed 网络会话 + FTP 传文件；未用 `installMusic`）**

| 层 | 机制 | 协议/API |
|---|---|---|
| 上传/删除会话控制 | raw BLE | `GlassesOrder.sendMusic`（0x34/0x08）+ 等 `GlassesMusicOperationEvent` ACK |
| 文件列表/传输 | SDK typed 网络 + FTP | `DeviceNetworkSessionClient.acquire(music)` → `BkFtpDeviceMusicTransferClient` 操作 `/Music` |
| 云端曲库 | 纯 App | REST 下载到本地 temp 再上传 |
| `session.media.installMusic` | **未使用** | — |

