## 快速对照表

| Feature | 分类 | BLE/设备交互要点 |
|---|---|---|
| `feature_translate` | 纯 App + 可选 raw BLE 单向推送 | HTTP SSE 翻译；可选 `sendSimInterText` |
| `feature_offline_translate` | 纯 App + 可选 raw BLE 单向推送 | 离线 ASR/translate + 手机 TTS；可选 `sendSimInterText` |
| P2P/AP 视频预览 | SDK typed + RTSP 播放器 | AKW ✅；BK 预览 ❌ |
| `feature_device_music` | 两者都有 | raw `sendMusic` 会话 + SDK 网络 + FTP |

**对比参考：** 完整 SimInter 双向 BLE（状态/TTS/眼镜按钮）在 `packages/feature/ai/feature_interpretation/lib/src/controller/interpretation_controller.dart`，translate Feature 只复用了同协议族中的「推送译文文本」一帧。
